title: Exfiltration via Discord Webhook
id: 96cc7210-139d-488c-b335-7fb38f63322b
status: experimental
description: Detects POSTs to Discord webhook endpoints (discord.com/api/webhooks) by non-Discord processes, a channel commonly used by stealers and RATs to exfiltrate data and receive commands.
author: Alaris Global
references:
  - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1567/
logsource:
  category: proxy
detection:
  selection:
    cs-host|contains:
      - 'discord.com/api/webhooks'
      - 'discordapp.com/api/webhooks'
    cs-method: 'POST'
  condition: selection
fields:
  - cs-host
  - cs-user-agent
  - c-ip
falsepositives:
  - Legitimate Discord webhook automation
level: high
tags:
  - attack.exfiltration
  - attack.t1567
